/name <text>  Names the session.  command
/reload  Reloads configuration, MCP servers and extensions.  command
/close  Stops the session on screen.  command
/quit  Quits.  command           ⌇ fiber 0.0.1
/approvals  Reopens the waiting approvals and questions.  command
